+# CVE-2026-71866 — not applicable to orval@7.13.2
+
+Object / property-key injection in generated Zod schemas lives in
+`@orval/zod` (`packages/zod/src/index.ts`, `JSON.stringify(key)`).
+
+This unit patches the `orval` CLI only (`packages/orval`). The supplied
+zod source patch cannot apply here.
+
+Remediation belongs on `@orval/zod` (see hooks/npm/@orval/zod/7.13.2
+on this MR).

