+# CVE-2026-62681 — not applicable to orval@7.13.2
+
+String / array default injection (`formatDefaultValue`) lives in
+`@orval/zod`. Core `getRoute` / `getKey` hunks live in `@orval/core`.
+
+This unit patches the `orval` CLI importer only. Those TypeScript
+paths are not in this package.
+
+Remediation belongs on `@orval/zod` and `@orval/core`.

